# dev-machine cargo config (mold linker) must not leak into the image build
.cargo
target
dist
mobile
.git
*.log
savegame.json
docs

# `build/` (icons, PWA manifest, platform packaging assets) is NOT excluded:
# index.html's trunk directives copy files straight out of it
# (build/windows/icon.ico, build/web/manifest.webmanifest, build/web/pwa/*,
# build/web/styles.css, build/web/sound.js) — excluding it breaks `trunk
# build` in the `web` Docker target. Only ~1MB, no reason to exclude it.
